  "sc:description": "Platform for managing biodiversity observations, available as a web application and an Android app. Supports data entry with standardised and custom forms, import from spreadsheets, querying, map visualisation, export and team access. Data remains under the control of the owner, who decides what is shared. Public datasets can be published with reduced coordinate precision to protect sensitive locations.",
